# Interactive live-harness labs. Both suites build their lab inside the repo root
# so the clone and its relative paths stay on one filesystem, and both remove it
# on exit - but an interrupted run, or a concurrent `git add -A`, would otherwise
# commit a whole nested checkout.
.pi-live-e2e.*
.omp-live-e2e.*
